1
00:00:00,606 --> 00:00:02,936
You're making a big deal.

2
00:00:03,142 --> 00:00:06,272
Sorry. You know, whatever.
Psh. It's all good.

3
00:00:07,413 --> 00:00:09,973
(Penny:)Anyway, that's it.
I just thought you should know.

4
00:00:10,149 --> 00:00:12,119
(Leonard:)Am I allowed to ask
how the class is going?

5
00:00:12,317 --> 00:00:15,017
It's good. We've been talking
about the origins of slavery.

6
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,980
- I turn in my first paper tomorrow.
- I can help with that.

7
00:00:18,157 --> 00:00:21,687
There's lots of perspectives to take.
Economic, sociological, political...

8
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,420
(Penny:)Hey, this is my paper.

9
00:00:23,629 --> 00:00:26,529
(Penny:)And my perspective
is that slavery is bad.

10
00:00:29,535 --> 00:00:33,095
(Penny:)And my professor's black,
so I'm pretty sure that's the right answer.

11
00:00:34,173 --> 00:00:37,633
- Can I take a look?
- No, Leonard. This is my thing.

12
00:00:37,843 --> 00:00:40,813
- Okay. I get it.
- Thank you.

13
00:00:41,013 --> 00:00:42,843
(Leonard:)It's like when I started doing chin-ups.

14
00:00:43,015 --> 00:00:45,145
(Leonard:)I didn't want you to see
until I could do one.

15
00:00:46,351 --> 00:00:49,111
(Leonard:)FYI, really close.

16
00:00:50,489 --> 00:00:52,859
(Penny:)Thank you. Now, behave yourself
and eat your dinner.

17
00:00:53,025 --> 00:00:55,965
And if you're lucky,
you get to sleep with a college girl.

18
00:00:56,128 --> 00:00:59,118
Really? I went to four years of college
and five years of grad school.

